# Spell levels (feat_spell_levels.py): Lucia at level 5 (index 4 at 0x020B46C0) opens
# Special in the first temple battle after Jian Fights; the list shows the spells learned by then:
# Healing Water and Cure Squall (Escape, at 6, is for the field only). Shots spells_lv5 and, after Down, spells_lv5_down. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
pin u32 0x020b46c0 4
wait 270
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot spells_lv5
press Down 8
wait 30
shot spells_lv5_down
